    "Create a sophisticated TEXT-FREE BACKGROUND for a vertical 1080\u00d71920 Instagram news graphic about a U.S. stock-market closing session. Distinct financial-market design: very deep midnight blue and charcoal, restrained icy cyan light, brushed gunmetal, premium exchange/interior architecture; avoid the orange office aesthetic. Layout: upper four fifths must function as one large clean midnight-blue glass news surface, x0\u2013920 and y0\u20131560, with exceptionally quiet texture and no objects or marks behind future text. All eventual news will fit x104\u2013961,y164\u20131536. At far right x930\u20131080, integrate a slender vertical architectural metallic support with a small, front-facing CIRCULAR EMPTY medallion mounting recess around center x998,y475, inner diameter130px. This is a physical recess on the support, with metal rim, reflected cool light and contact shadow; generate NO coin face, portrait or lettering. The actual original Moneyberg coin will be installed in this recess separately, wholly above y1440, preserving its circular shape. Below y1580 reveal an elegant exchange-floor still life: dark trading workstations and the edge of a brushed-metal console, glass partitions, a few vertical blue LED lights, distant Manhattan-style financial buildings at twilight reflected in glass. No identifiable actual exchange location, no logos, no people, no screens containing words/numbers/charts. Any computer monitors are blank dark-blue reflective glass. No upward/downward graph, arrows, candles, invented ticker data or values. A financial environment with subtle depth and cool light, not a data visualization. Distinct material surfaces and careful cinematic composition; typography area dominates and remains calm. The finished graphic will have a compact single-line 'MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF' brand in Lato Black900; headlines and financial labels in Lato Black900; body and sources in Georgia400; all authored text at least33px, body35px, headline51px. DO NOT render any of that text now. Add no typography, cards, banners, labels, footers, watermarks or lettering of any kind. Generate only the blank richly designed stock-market environment; actual index rows/text and the exact supplied coin will be composed later."
